  m_Name: _DERS NOTU
  m_TagString: Untagged
  m_Icon: {fileID: 0}
  m_NavMeshLayer: 0
  m_StaticEditorFlags: 0
  m_IsActive: 1
--- !u!114 &769053538
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 769053537}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 445e13603f407004589a4378f99edb2c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DersNotu
  dersBasligi: "Mod\xFCl 3 | Ders 10 | \u0130nterpolasyon"
  amac: "Bu sahne dersin sonundaki durumdur. Her k\xFCre farkl\u0131 bir e\u011Fri
    kullan\u0131r. Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n, Game penceresine t\u0131klay\u0131n
    ve bo\u015Fluk tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. Kamera yakla\u015F\u0131r ve bilgi paneli
    a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r.\n\nD\xF6rt k\xFCreyi ayn\u0131 yolda, ayn\u0131 s\xFCrede
    ama farkl\u0131 yumu\u015Fatma e\u011Frileriyle hareket ettiriyoruz. E\u011Frilerin
    grafi\u011Fini yolun \xFCzerinde izliyoruz. Ard\u0131ndan ayn\u0131 betikle kameray\u0131
    iki durak aras\u0131nda yumu\u015Fak bi\xE7imde ta\u015F\u0131yor ve bir aray\xFCz
    panelini ekrana kayd\u0131r\u0131yoruz."
  adimlar:
  - "Ders10_Baslangic sahnesini a\xE7\u0131n. Project penceresinde Betikler klas\xF6r\xFCndeki
    Yumusatma ve EgriIleHareket betiklerini a\xE7\u0131n. Uygula fonksiyonundaki
    d\xF6rt e\u011Friyi ve Update i\xE7indeki oran hesab\u0131n\u0131 bulun."
  - "Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. D\xF6rt k\xFCre birlikte gider ve birlikte d\xF6ner.
    Yollar\u0131n \xFCzerindeki sar\u0131 grafikler d\xFCz \xE7izgidir. Play modundan
    \xE7\u0131k\u0131n."
  - "Kure2 nesnesini se\xE7in ve Egri alan\u0131n\u0131 Yavas Basla yap\u0131n. Kure3
    i\xE7in Yavas Bitir, Kure4 i\xE7in Yumusak Gecis se\xE7in. Sar\u0131 grafiklerin
    bi\xE7imi de\u011Fi\u015Fir."
  - "Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. K\xFCreler ayn\u0131 anda yola \xE7\u0131kar ve
    ayn\u0131 anda var\u0131r ama yolda birbirinden ayr\u0131l\u0131r. Play modundan
    \xE7\u0131k\u0131n."
  - "Kure1 nesnesini se\xE7in ve Egri alan\u0131n\u0131 Ozel yap\u0131n. Ozel Egri
    kutusuna t\u0131klay\u0131n. E\u011Frinin sonuna yak\u0131n bir yere \xE7ift
    t\u0131klayarak nokta ekleyin ve noktay\u0131 1 de\u011Ferinin biraz \xFCst\xFCne
    \xE7ekin. Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. Kure1 hedefi a\u015F\u0131p geri d\xF6ner.
    Play modundan \xE7\u0131k\u0131n."
  - "Main Camera nesnesini se\xE7in ve EgriIleHareket beti\u011Fini ekleyin. Baslangic
    alan\u0131na KameraA, Bitis alan\u0131na KameraB nesnesini s\xFCr\xFCkleyin.
    Egri alan\u0131n\u0131 Yumusak Gecis, Sure de\u011Ferini 1.2 yap\u0131n ve Boslukla
    Tetikle kutusunu i\u015Faretleyin."
  - "Canvas nesnesini se\xE7in ve PanelAcKapa beti\u011Fini ekleyin. Canvas alt\u0131ndaki
    BilgiPaneli nesnesini beti\u011Fin Panel alan\u0131na s\xFCr\xFCkleyin."
  - "Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n, Game penceresine t\u0131klay\u0131n ve bo\u015Fluk
    tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. Kamera k\xFCrelere yakla\u015F\u0131r ve panel sa\u011Fdan
    kayarak gelir. Bo\u015Fluk tu\u015Funa yeniden bas\u0131n. Play modundan \xE7\u0131k\u0131n."
  kendinDene:
  - "D\xF6rt k\xFCrenin Sure de\u011Ferini 0.5 yap\u0131n. E\u011Friler aras\u0131ndaki
    fark h\xE2l\xE2 se\xE7ilebiliyor mu? 5 yap\u0131n ve yeniden bak\u0131n."
  - "PanelAcKapa bile\u015Feninde Egri alan\u0131n\u0131 Dogrusal yap\u0131n ve panelin
    a\xE7\u0131l\u0131\u015F\u0131n\u0131 Yavas Bitir ile kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131n."
  - "Yumusatma beti\u011Fine `t * t * t` form\xFCl\xFCyle be\u015Finci bir e\u011Fri
    ekleyin. Yava\u015F ba\u015Fla e\u011Frisinden fark\u0131 nedir?"
  - "KameraB i\u015Faret\xE7isini ta\u015F\u0131y\u0131n ve d\xF6nd\xFCr\xFCn. Kameran\u0131n
    bo\u015Fluk tu\u015Fuyla gitti\u011Fi yer nas\u0131l de\u011Fi\u015Fiyor?"
